<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">RRK33.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">Miika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Miika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Miika</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mik</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">MIIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugwerwa kubi Abayuda ahabw'okuramya ebishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:1">Isa 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:8">Yer 26:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:1">Hos 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyaizire ahari Miika owa Moresheeshi, eki yaayorekirwe ahari Samaria na Yerusaalemu, omu busingye bwa Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekia abagabe ba Yuda.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:4">Zab 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:7">50:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:2">Isa 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:5">Mal 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu 'mwe, mwena, nimuhurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">Naiwe ensi n'ebigirimu byona, mutegye amatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">Mukama RUHANGA abe niwe yaababeera mushinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">Naayema omuri hekalu ye erikwera.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:21">Isa 26:21</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:13">Amo 4:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba reeba, MUKAMA naija naaruga omu mwanya gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:3">Naija kushuuma, aribatiirire ebibungo by'omu nsi.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 97:5">Zab 97:5</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:5">Nah 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi enshozi ziryayagira ahansi ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">N'empanga zigangabukye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">Nke'cumbwe omu maisho g'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">Nari nk'amaizi gaashukwa aheecurikire.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 28:4">2 Bus 28:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona n'ahabw'ekicumuro kya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:5">N'ahabw'ebibi by'enju ya Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:5">Beitu ekicumuro kya Yakobo nikiiha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:5">Ti Samaria?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:5">Kandi ekibi ky'enju ya Yuda nikiiha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:5">Ti Yerusaalemu?<verse eid="MIC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:24">1 Bag 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:12">Mik 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ndyagira Samaria omutuumo omu bwerere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:6">Omwanya gw'okubyaramu emizaabibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:6">Ndyashuka amabaare ge omu ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:6">Nshuuruure emisingi ye.<verse eid="MIC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 2:12">Hos 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:6">8:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebishushani bye byona biryahondagurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">Ebihembo bye byona biryayokibwa omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">Kandi ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa ndyabicwekyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">Ahabw'okuba akabiiha omu bihembo bya maraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:7">Kandi niyo birigaruka.<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:29">Yob 30:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 20:2-4">Isa 20:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:4">22:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ndyatonzya, mboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:8">Ngyende ntajwaire nkaito, kandi njwaire busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:8">Ndyatonzya, nimboigora nka zaamuha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:8">Ncure nka zaamaaya.<verse eid="MIC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:13">Hos 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba obuhuta bwe ti bw'okutambwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:9">Buhikire ahari Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:9">Bwahika n'aha irembo ry'abantu bangye omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:20">2 Sam 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:26">Yer 6:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutakigamba omuri Gaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:10">Mutarira na kakye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:10">Mwekuringye omu mucuucu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:10">Omuri Besi-leafura.<verse eid="MIC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Imwe batuuzi ba Shafiri 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">Murabeho mujwaire busha, mwine enshoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">Abatuuzi ba Zaanani tibarikushohora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">Okuborooga kwa Betazeeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:11">Kuryabazibira ku ebaha emikono.<verse eid="MIC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba abatuuzi ba Maroosi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:12">Bategyereize ebirungi beemereize emitima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:12">Ahakuba akabi kashuumire nikaruga ahari MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:12">Kaahika aha irembo rya Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:14">2 Bag 18:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:1">Hos 13:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe batuuzi ba Lakishi 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:13">Mukomere ebigaari aha mbaraasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:13">Niimwe mwabandize kucumuza Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:13">Ahabw'okuba omuriimwe nimwo ebicumuro bya Israeli byashangirwe.<verse eid="MIC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Nikyo oriheera Moresheeti-gaasi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:14">Ebiconco by'okuragana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:14">Amaju ga Akiziibu gakaba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:14">Eky'okureebya abagabe ba Israeli.<verse eid="MIC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Naimwe batuuzi ba Mareesha 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:15">Ndyagaruka mbareeteho ow'okubasingura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:15">Kandi ekitiinisa kya Israeli kiryahika Adulaamu.<verse eid="MIC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:12">Isa 22:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwemwe enkomborora, mushare amashokye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:16">Ahabw'abaana baanyu abu murikukunda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:16">Mwemwe enkomborora, emitwe yaanyu ebe nk'ey'ebihuhura-bahuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:16">Ahabw'okuba baryaruga omuriimwe, batwarwe omu bukwatwa.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okufubira abantu ahabw'okukora kubi enshoberwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:4">Zab 36:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryakareeba, abacuma enaama z'obubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:1">Bakakora kubi bakiri aha bitabo byabo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:1">Kandi bukisheesha, bakabikora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:1">Ahabw'okuba biri omu bushoboorozi bwabo.<verse eid="MIC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:8">Isa 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibeetenga ebibanja by'abandi, babikwata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:2">Kandi beetenga n'amaju, baganyaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:2">Bahata omuntu n'eka ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:2">Omuntu n'obuhunguzi bwe.<verse eid="MIC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:1">Amo 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 3:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:13">5:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Yer 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">Reeba, nincumira oru ruganda enaama y'okurureetaho akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">Aku mutaribaasa kwiha mu bitsya byanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">Kandi timurigyenda na myekuniko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:3">Ahabw'okuba obunaku obwo buryaba bubi.<verse eid="MIC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:6">Hab 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba baryayeshongora ekyeshongoro ky'okubagaaniiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Baboroogye, nibatonzya n'obusaasi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Nibagira bati: Tumariirweho kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Yaahingisa omugabo gw'abantu bangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Mbwenu ka yaaguunyaka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Emisiri yaitu agibaganisiize abarikutunyaga.<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Nikyo muriburira ow'okubaganisisa omugoye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:5">Emigabo y'omu ihanga rya MUKAMA.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 2:12">Amo 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo nibahanuura bati: Mutahanuura!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:6">Omuntu tashemereire kuhanuura ebigambo nk'ebi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:6">Okuhemuka tikurituhikaho.<verse eid="MIC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Iwe nju ya Yakobo 'we, eki kikaagambirwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">Omwoyo wa MUKAMA takiine kugumisiriza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">Ebi niwe arikubikora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">Ebigambo byangye tibirikugasira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:7">Orikugyenda n'omutima gugororokire?<verse eid="MIC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 28:8">2 Bus 28:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mwimukire kurwanisa abantu bangye nk'omuzigu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:8">Abarikuba nibahingura baine obusingye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:8">Batarikwenda kurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:8">Mubaaka eminagiro yaabo.<verse eid="MIC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Abakazi b'abantu bangye mubabinga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:9">Omu maju gaabo marungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:9">N'abaana baabo abato mubaihiraho kimwe ekitiinisa kyangye.<verse eid="MIC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:25">Lev 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:9">Bir 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:14">Heb 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwimukye mugyende;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:10">Ahabw'okuba ogu ti mwanya gw'okuhuumuriramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:10">Ahabw'oburofa bwagwo oburikucwekyereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:10">Okucwekyereza kubi munonga.<verse eid="MIC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 2:12">Amo 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:13">Yer 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu orikugyendagyenda, naagamba eby'omwoyo n'eby'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:11">Naagira ati: Niinyija kubahanuurira ebya viinyo n'ebirikusinza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:11">Ogwo niwe yaakuba nabi w'aba bantu!<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:11">2 Bag 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:10">Yer 31:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mik 4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yakobo, abaawe boona ndyabataaruura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Ntaaruure Abaisraeli abatsigaireho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Ndyabateeranira hamwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Nk'entaama eziri omu kibuga kyazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Nk'obusyo oburi omu iriisizo ryabwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:12">Bagire akaari kaingi ahabw'okuba baingi.<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:10">2 Bag 25:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:12">Isa 52:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:6-7">Mik 4:6-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikusheenya ah'okuraba, aryabeebembera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:13">Bahabandanire, bashohore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:13">Nibaraba omu irembo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:13">Omugabe waabo aryarabaho, abaze omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:13">MUKAMA abeebembeire.<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ebibi by'abanyiginya n'ebya baanabi baabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:5">Yer 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagira nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:1">Imwe bakuru ba Yakobo 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:1">Naimwe abategyeki b'enju ya Israeli, nimuhurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:1">T'omurimo gwanyu okumanya eby'oburyo?<verse eid="MIC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 34:3">Ezk 34:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abanga ebirungi, mukakunda ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:2">Abantu bangye mukabaihaho oruhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:2">Mukoonoora enyama aha magufa gaabo,<verse eid="MIC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:4">Zab 14:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukagirya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">Mukababaagaho oruhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">Mukabacwagacwagura amagufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">Mukabatematema nk'enyama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">Ezi barikwenda kuta omu rwabya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:3">Nari omu nyungu egoya.<verse eid="MIC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:17">Bir 31:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo baryatakira MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:4">Kwonka taribagarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:4">Omuri obwo bunaku aryabaima amaisho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:4">Ahabw'okukora kubi omu mitwarize yaabo.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:14">Yer 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:13">23:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari baanabi abarikuhabya abantu bangye, bakagira ngu, N'obusingye, obu baine eby'okurya, haza bakarwanisa owaabura eki yaabatamika.<verse eid="MIC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:24">Ezk 12:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo biribabeerera ekiro, mukabura okworekwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:6">Bikababeera omwirima, mukabura okuragura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:6">Eizooba riryarengyera ahari baanabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:6">Na nyomushana ebairagurire;<verse eid="MIC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 8:11">Amo 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:4">Zek 13:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abahanuuzi baryahemuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:7">N'abafumu baitwe enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:7">Boona engaro bazite aha munwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:7">Ahabw'okubura okugarukamu kwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:1">Isa 58:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nyowe nyijwire amaani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:8">Ahabw'Omwoyo wa MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:8">Nyijwirwe obwinganisa n'obushoboorozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:8">Bw'okumanyisa Yakobo ekicumuro kye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:8">Na Israeli ekibi kye.<verse eid="MIC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Nimuhurire eki, imwe bakuru b'enju ya Yakobo 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:9">N'abategyeki b'enju ya Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:9">Abangira kimwe eby'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:9">Obwinganisa bwona mukabukiikamya,<verse eid="MIC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:13">Yer 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:27">Ezk 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:12">Hab 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abombekyesa Saayuuni eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:10">Na Yerusaalemu mukagyombekyesa okukora kubi.<verse eid="MIC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:23">Isa 1:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:2">48:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:4">7:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:17">23:17</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:3">Mik 7:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abakuru baayo bacwa emanja z'enguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">Abanyamurwa baayo beegyesa ahabw'okugurirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">Na baanabi baayo baragura ahabw'empiiha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">Haza beegamira MUKAMA nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">MUKAMA tari omuriitwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">Tihaine kabi karituhikaho.<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 26:18">Yer 26:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Saayuuni erihingirwa nk'omusiri ahabwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:12">Yerusaalemu ekaba omutuumo gw'ebisheenyuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:12">N'orushozi rw'enju ya MUKAMA rukaba nk'ekibungo kishwekirwe ekibira.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura aha bukama bwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:2-4">Isa 2:2-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omu biro by'aha muheru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">Orushozi rw'enju ya MUKAMA ruryahamibwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">Kuba orushozi orurikukira ezindi aha mutwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">Rutunguurwe, ruze ahaiguru y'ebibungo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">Kandi amahanga garyahimintikirayo.<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />N'amahanga maingi garyaija gagire gati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Nimwije twinamukye aha rushozi rwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Aha nju ya Ruhanga wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Atwegyese emihanda ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Tubone kugigyenderamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Ahakuba omuri Saayuuni nimwo hariruga Ebiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">N'omuri Yerusaalemu hakarugamu ekigambo kya MUKAMA.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:10">Yoel 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryaramura amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Ahane amahanga g'amaani agari hare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Zaarurara zaabo baryaziheeshamu amafuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">N'amacumu gaabo bagaheeshemu empabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Eihanga tiriribangira rindi rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">Kandi tibarigaruka kwega by'engamba;<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:25">1 Bag 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:20">Isa 1:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka buri muntu aryashutama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">Ahansi y'omuzaabibu gwe n'ahansi y'omutiini gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">Kandi tihaine oribakangisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 10:12">Zek 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba amahanga goona nigagyenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:5">Buri rimwe omu iziina rya ruhanga waaryo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:5">Kwonka itwe turyaguma nitugyendera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:5">Omu iziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu okuhitsya ryari na ryari.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 11:17">Ezk 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:16">34:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Eryo izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:6">Ndyateeranira hamwe ebirema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:6">Ntaaruure abaataataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:6">N'abu naabonaboneise.<verse eid="MIC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:6">Zab 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:23">Isa 24:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:33">Luk 1:33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:22">Heb 12:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo birema nibyo ndigira abaatsigaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:7">N'abacwirwe mbagire eihanga ry'amaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:7">Kandi MUKAMA aryabategyekyera aha rushozi Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:7">Okwiha obwo okuhitsya ebiro byona.<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />Kandi naiwe, munaara gw'obusyo 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:8">Ekibungo Saayuuni niiwe kirihikaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:8">Obutegyeki bwa ira bukagaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:8">Obutegyeki bwa Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="MIC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:19">Yer 8:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ekirikukuboroozya niki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:9">Omuriiwe tiharimu omugabe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:9">Omuhanuuzi waawe afiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:9">Obusaasi bwaza kukukwata nk'omukazi orikurumwa?<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 39:6">Isa 39:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 39:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:22">44:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 44:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Saayuuni 'we, yehotore, otsinde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Nk'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Ahakuba hati waaza kuruga omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Otuure omu bwerere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Bwanyima oze Babulooni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Okwo niyo MUKAMA arikucungurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:10">Akakwiha omu mikono y'abazigu baawe.<verse eid="MIC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="OBA 1:12">Oba 12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:10">Mik 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:3">Zek 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hati amahanga maingi gateeraine kukurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:11">Nigagira gati: Saayuuni k'eshiishwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:11">Tugishamaarire.<verse eid="MIC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:12">Hab 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka tigarikumanya biteekateeko bya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:12">N'obu kwakuba okwetegyereza enaama ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:12">Ku agateeraniire hamwe nk'ebiba ebirunzire aha mbuga.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:28">Lev 27:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:5">Zab 97:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:18">Isa 23:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Saayuuni 'we, imuka ohuure;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">Ahabw'okuba eihembe ryawe ndyarihindura ekyoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">N'ebyara by'ebigyere byawe mbigire emiringa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">Oryacwagacwagura amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">Amagoba gaabo ogahongyere MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:13">N'eitungo ryago oryereze MUKAMA ow'ensi yoona.<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Mbwenu oyehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:1">Twagotwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:1">Nibateeza omutegyeki wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:1">Enkono aha matama.<verse eid="MIC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Kristo n'obukama bwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 35:19">Kut 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Zab 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:22">Enf 8:22</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 8:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 9:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:3">Hos 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:6">Mat 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yoh 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">7:42</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:14">Heb 7:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe, Betelehemu eya Efuraata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">Ori mukye kubarirwa omu nganda za Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">Omuriiwe nimwo hariruga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">Orimbeera omutegyeki wa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">Ou obukomooko bwe buri obwa iranaira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:2">Omu biro ebitakimanywa.<verse eid="MIC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mik 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 4:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 4:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo aribaheerayo okuhitsya obunaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:3">Obu orikurumwa arizaariramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:3">Obwo ab'omuri beene ishe abariba batsigaireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:3">Baryagarukira Abaisraeli.<verse eid="MIC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Zab 72:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:3-5">Isa 11:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:11">40:11</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:14">Mik 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:32">Luk 1:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nawe aryahama, ariise obusyo bwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">Aine amaani ga MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">N'ekitiinisa ky'eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">Kandi nabo baryatuura buhooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">Ahabw'okuba aryaba mukuru okuhitsya aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:4">Kandi omuntu ogwo aryaba obusingye bwaitu.<verse eid="MIC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:13">2 Bag 18:13</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:14">Efe 2:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuasiria ku ariteera ensi yaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:5">Yaagiribatiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:5">Turyaimutsya abariisa mushanju</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:5">N'abanyiginya munaana, bamurwanise.<verse eid="MIC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 10:8">Kut 10:8</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 10:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 10:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baryategyekyesa ensi ya Asiria rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:6">N'ensi ya Nimuroodi bagitegyekyese rurara esyoirweyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:6">Kandi Omuasirira ku arirenga emyatano yaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:6">Yaateera ensi yaitu, yaagiribatiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:6">Nibo barimutujuna.<verse eid="MIC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Batyo aba Yakobo abariba batsigaireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:7">Baryaba ahagati y'amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:7">Nk'orume orurugire ahari MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:7">Nari nk'orutoonyerera orurikugwa aha bunyaatsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:7">Orutarinda muntu, n'obu kwakuba okutegyereza abantu.<verse eid="MIC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:14">Hos 5:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi aba Yakobo abariba batsigaireho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Baryaba omu mahanga ahagati y'amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Nk'entare eri ahagati y'enyamaishwa z'omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Kandi nk'omugunju gw'entare oguri omu busyo bw'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Oguba niguzirabamu, gukaziribatiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:8">Gukazitaagataagura, hakabura ow'okuzijuna.<verse eid="MIC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukono gwawe guryabangirwa abazigu baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:9">N'abarikukwanga boona bamarweho.<verse eid="MIC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:7">Isa 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Zek 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Eryo izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:10">Ndyakumaraho embaraasi zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:10">N'ebigaari byawe by'orugamba mbicwekyereze.<verse eid="MIC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:9">Isa 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:14">Hos 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyamaraho endembo z'omu nsi yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:11">N'ebigo byawe byona mbisheenye.<verse eid="MIC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:10">Bir 18:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyamaraho oburugo oburi omu ngaro zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:12">Kandi torigira barangi bundi.<verse eid="MIC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:22">Bir 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 17:8">Isa 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:4">Hos 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:2">Zek 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakumaramu ebishushani byawe n'enyomyo zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:13">Kandi torigaruka kuramya bikozirwe emikono yaawe.<verse eid="MIC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakuranduramu za Ashera zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:14">Ncwekyereze endembo zaawe;<verse eid="MIC 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 149:7">Zab 149:7</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 Tes 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi amahanga agataroorobire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 5:15">Ndyagahoora enzigu ngwirwe kubi, ngainiire ekiniga.<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ebi Ruhanga ayenda aha bantu be</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Mbwenu nimuhurire eki MUKAMA arikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:1">Mwimukye, mwetonganire omu maisho g'enshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:1">Ebibungo bihurire eiraka ryanyu.<verse eid="MIC 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:4">Ezk 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:1">Hos 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe nshozi 'mwe, nimuhurire okutongana kwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:2">Naimwe emisingi y'ensi ey'entuura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:2">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aine eki arikufa n'abantu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:2">Kandi naatonganisa Israeli.<verse eid="MIC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:22">Isa 43:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:5">Yer 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:13">Mal 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, mbwenu ndabaitsize ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:3">Ndabaruhize na ki? Nimungarukyemu!<verse eid="MIC 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kur 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">15:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba nkabaiha omu nsi ya Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:4">Naabacungura omu nju y'obuhuuku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:4">Naatuma Musa, Arooni na Miriamu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:4">Kubeebembera.<verse eid="MIC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 22:5">Kub 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:1">25:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 4:19">Yos 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:29">Bar 11:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, mwijukye enaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:5">Ei Balaki omugabe wa Moabu yaacumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:5">N'eki Balamu mwene Beori yaamugarukiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:5">Kandi n'ebyabaireho okuruga Shitimu okuhika Gilugaali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:5">Ngu mubone kumanya eby'okujuna ebi MUKAMA yaakozire.<verse eid="MIC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Isa 57:15</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:6">Hos 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:4">Heb 10:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyije na ki omu maisho ga MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:6">Nkainama omu maisho ga Ruhanga orikukira boona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:6">Nyije omu maisho ge n'ebitambo by'okwotsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:6">N'enyana ezihikize omwaka gumwe?<verse eid="MIC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo MUKAMA naija kusiima empaya z'entaama enkumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:7">Nari emigyera y'emajuta obukumi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:7">Mpeyo omwana wangye w'omujigaijo ahabw'ekicumuro kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:7">Ekyana ky'omubiri gwangye nkihongye ahabw'ekibi ky'amagara gangye?<verse eid="MIC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:22">Kut 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:12">Bir 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe muntu we, akworekire ekirungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:8">Mbwenu eki MUKAMA arikukwenza niki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:8">Kureka okukora eby'oburyo, okukunda embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:8">N'okugyenda na Ruhanga waawe n'obucureezi?<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5">Isa 10:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagambira orurembo n'eiraka rihango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:9">Kandi okutiina eiziina ryawe n'obwengye buhikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:9">Iwe ruganda 'we, kandi naimwe abateeraine omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:9">Nimuhurire.<verse eid="MIC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Nimugira ngu nkaabaasa kwebwa eitungo ry'obubi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:10">Eriri omu nju y'enkozi z'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:10">Kandi n'endengo zitahikire ezikyeenirwe?<verse eid="MIC 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 12:7">Hos 12:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oine omunzaani mubi, mmwiheho orubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:11">N'oine enshaho y'amabaare agu arikugobezesa?<verse eid="MIC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:10">Amo 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:8">Yer 9:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatungi baanyu baijwire obubisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:12">Abatuuzi baawe nibabeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:12">Kandi orurimi rw'omu kanwa kaabo niruryarya.<verse eid="MIC 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Nikyo ntandikiire kubateera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:13">Nkabahindura enshoberwa ahabw'ebibi byanyu.<verse eid="MIC 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:10">Hos 4:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryarya, kwonka timurihaaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:14">Omuriimwe haryabamu enjara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:14">Muryabiika, kwonka ebi muribiika tibirigumaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:14">Kandi ebi muribiika ndyabigaburira rurara.<verse eid="MIC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:38-40">Bir 28:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:13">Zef 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryabiba, kwonka timurigyesha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Muryanyuuka ebyana by'emitiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Kwonka timuryesiiga majuta gaabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Muryanyuuka ebijuma by'emizaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:15">Kwonka timurinywa viinyo yaabyo;<verse eid="MIC 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:25-33">1 Bag 16:25-33</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:8">2 Bus 29:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba mukoorobera ebiragiro bya Omuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">N'ebyakozirwe ab'enju ya Ahabu byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">Kandi mutuura nimukuratira obwengye bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">Nikyo naaza kubahindurira enshoberwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">N'abatuuzi baanyu nkabagira eky'okweshaanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 6:16">Mutyo mukaba ekirikugaywa amahanga.<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Oku Ruhanga aimutsya abagwire, akabasaasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:13">Isa 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:10">Hos 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshi naareeba! Ahabw'okuba mpindukire nk'orikusherura ebijuma by'omu kyanda, ahu baaherize kushoroma, n'eby'emizaabibu, ahu baaherize kuhumba, hakabura omutsitsa na gumwe gw'okurya, n'obu kyakuba ekijuma ky'omutiini eky'omujigaijo eki omutima gwangye gurikwetenga.<verse eid="MIC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:9">Zab 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:1">14:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 14:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:19">Isa 9:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikutiina Ruhanga bahweire omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:2">Kandi omu bantu tihariho n'omwe oine omutima gugororokire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:2">Boona nibagwera kusheesha eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:2">Buri muntu naatega mwene ishe ekigoye.<verse eid="MIC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:1">Zab 82:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 82:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mik 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:7">Zef 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emikono yaabo neekununkirira ekibi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">Kukikoresa obweziriki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">Omutegyeki n'omuramuzi nibashaba enguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">N'omuntu mukuru naagamba butunu ekibi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">Eki omutima gwe gurikwetenga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:3">Okwo nikwo barikubugaabuganisa enaama zaabo.<verse eid="MIC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:5">Isa 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:6">Ezk 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:2">33:2</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:10">Nah 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omurungi omuribo ni nk'omukwatangwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:4">N'orikukira kuba ohikiriire omuribo ni nk'orugo rw'amahwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:4">Eizooba ry'abarinzi baabo, kandi ery'okufubirwa kwabo ryahika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:4">Mbwenuho baarimbagirirwa.<verse eid="MIC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:4">Yer 9:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muteesiga omutaahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:5">Mutagira obwesigye ahari munywani waanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:5">Kandi okwate akanwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:5">Nangwa n'aha mukazi waawe ou ofumbata;<verse eid="MIC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:21">Mat 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:35">35</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:36">36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba omwana naagaya ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:6">Omwishiki naagomera nyina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:6">N'omukaamwana naagomera nyina-zaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:6">Kandi abazigu b'omuntu n'ab'omu ka ye.<verse eid="MIC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 3:26">Tonz 3:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nyowe amaisho gangye ndyagata ahari MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:7">Ntegyereze Ruhanga ow'okujunwa kwangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:7">Ruhanga wangye aryampurira.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:24">Zab 37:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 112:4">112:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:11">Yer 50:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe muzigu wangye 'we, otaanyesiimirana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:8">N'obu ndigwa, ndyaimuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:8">N'obu ndishutama omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:8">MUKAMA aryambeera omushana.<verse eid="MIC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 24:15">1 Sam 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:6">Zab 37:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:19">Yer 10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyayemera ekiniga kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Ahabw'okuba nkamugomera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Okuhitysa obu arintonganira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Akansingirira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Aryanshohoza ampitsye omu mushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:9">Ndeebe okuhikiirira kwe;<verse eid="MIC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:42">Zab 18:42</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:17">Yoel 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:11">Mik 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza omuzigu wangye akireebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">Akwatwe enshoni, owangizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">Amaisho gangye garyamwesiimirana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">Kandi obwo aryaribatiirirwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:10">Nk'ebyondo by'omu muhanda.<verse eid="MIC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo 9:11</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 9:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba ry'okwombekyeraho engo zaawe z'amabaare!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:11">Eryo izooba emyatano eryairizibwa hare.<verse eid="MIC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:11">Isa 11:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Zek 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba baryabahika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:12">Barugire Asiria okuhika Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:12">Okuruga Misri okuhika aha mugyera Furaati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:12">Okuruga aha nyanja okuhika aha ndiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:12">Okuruga aha rushozi okuhika aha rundi.<verse eid="MIC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 6:13">Mik 6:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ensi eryahinduka eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:13">Neeturwa abatuuzi baayo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:13">Ahabw'ebirugire omu bi barikukora.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Zab 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:9">28:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:19">Yer 50:19</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:4">Mik 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Riisa abantu baawe n'enkoni yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Obusyo bw'obuhunguzi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Abatuura bonka omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Eriri omuri Bashani na Gileadi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:14">Nk'omu biro bya ira.<verse eid="MIC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:12">Zab 78:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabooreka eby'okutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:15">Nk'ebi naayorekire, obu waabaire nooruga Misri.<verse eid="MIC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 18:19">Bar 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga garyabireeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:16">Gakwatirwe enshoni amaani gaago goona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:16">Engaro gazite aha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:16">N'amatu gaago gaigare.<verse eid="MIC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:45">Zab 18:45</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:9">72:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:23">Isa 49:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi garyarigatsa omucuucu nk'enjoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">Nk'ebintu by'omu nsi ebirikugyendesa enda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">Baryaruga omu bigo byabo nibatetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">Bahindukire MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu baine obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:17">Batiine ahabwawe.<verse eid="MIC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kur 34:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:9">Zab 103:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni ruhanga ki orikushushana naiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:18">Osaasira okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:18">Oyehuzya ebicumuro by'ab'obuhunguzi bwe abatsigaireho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:18">Taguma na kiniga ebiro byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:18">Ahabw'okuba ashemerererwa embabazi.<verse eid="MIC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:14">Zab 80:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:17">Isa 38:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:14">Rom 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryagaruka kutugirira esaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:19">Aryaribatiirira eby'okushiisha byaitu ahansi y'ebigyere bye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:19">Oryanaga ebibi byaitu byona omu maizi maingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:19">Agari ahagati y'enyanja.<verse eid="MIC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 105:9">Zab 105:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 105:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:72">Luk 1:72</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:73">73</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryakorera Yakobo eby'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:20">Na Abrahamu omukorere eby'embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:20">Nk'oku waaraganiise baatatenkuriirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 7:20">Okwiha omu biro bya ira.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>